{"slug": "C_S03E04", "video_name": "Community - S03E04 - Remedial Chaos Theory Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E04 - Remedial Chaos Theory Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1281.541, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 588, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.6153846153846154, "text": "-Didn't they say 304?"}, {"start": 1.6153846153846154, "end": 2.3076923076923075, "text": "-No, 303."}, {"start": 2.3076923076923075, "end": 4.0, "text": "I wrote it down twice."}, {"start": 4.0, "end": 9.314285714285713, "text": "-Troy and Abit's new apartment!"}, {"start": 9.314285714285713, "end": 10.0, "text": "-Hi!"}, {"start": 10.0, "end": 13.0, "text": "-Come on in, come on in."}, {"start": 13.0, "end": 13.625, "text": "-Wow."}, {"start": 13.625, "end": 16.0, "text": "What a great place."}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 17.44578313253012, "text": "-You guys look so fancy."}, {"start": 17.44578313253012, "end": 17.927710843373493, "text": "-Thanks."}, {"start": 17.927710843373493, "end": 21.0, "text": "We read a book on how to be the perfect party host."}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 22.43661971830986, "text": "Rule number one, dress to impress."}, {"start": 22.43661971830986, "end": 24.0, "text": "-Rule number two, avoid touchy topics"}, {"start": 24.0, "end": 25.672727272727272, "text": "like the Negro problem."}, {"start": 25.672727272727272, "end": 28.0, "text": "The book was written in the 40s."}, {"start": 28.0, "end": 28.666666666666668, "text": "-Oh, good."}, {"start": 28.666666666666668, "end": 30.400000000000002, "text": "You guys are finally here."}, {"start": 30.400000000000002, "end": 31.0, "text": "-Finally."}, {"start": 31.0, "end": 32.47272727272727, "text": "-Surely showed up at three."}, {"start": 32.47272727272727, "end": 34.0, "text": "-Time flies when I'm baking."}, {"start": 34.0, "end": 34.94117647058823, "text": "-No, it doesn't."}, {"start": 34.94117647058823, "end": 38.0, "text": "-Oh, the door downstairs was propped open with this."}, {"start": 38.0, "end": 38.9041095890411, "text": "This is really unsafe."}, {"start": 38.9041095890411, "end": 41.0, "text": "Anyone could have just wandered into your building."}, {"start": 41.0, "end": 42.63636363636363, "text": "-Like one of our guests?"}, {"start": 42.63636363636363, "end": 44.0, "text": "-I'll be right back."}, {"start": 44.0, "end": 44.61818181818182, "text": "-Thank you, Troy."}, {"start": 44.61818181818182, "end": 46.0, "text": "Let me give you ladies the grand tour."}, {"start": 46.0, "end": 47.58181818181818, "text": "Bathroom, kitchen, who cares?"}, {"start": 47.58181818181818, "end": 49.0, "text": "And this is my scale model"}, {"start": 49.0, "end": 52.0, "text": "of the Rolling Bolder scene from Raiders with actual Rolling Bolder."}, {"start": 52.0, "end": 52.4, "text": "-Oh."}, {"start": 52.4, "end": 53.0, "text": "-Yeah."}, {"start": 53.0, "end": 54.3, "text": "Adios, pizza."}, {"start": 54.3, "end": 54.699999999999996, "text": "-Oh."}, {"start": 54.699999999999996, "end": 56.199999999999996, "text": "-I have a wand."}, {"start": 56.199999999999996, "end": 58.0, "text": "-Pretty cool, huh?"}, {"start": 58.0, "end": 59.8421052631579, "text": "-Super cool and sexy."}, {"start": 59.8421052631579, "end": 61.24561403508772, "text": "Super sexy cool."}, {"start": 61.24561403508772, "end": 63.0, "text": "-Oh, for selling it."}, {"start": 63.0, "end": 64.02439024390245, "text": "-I made pizza."}, {"start": 64.02439024390245, "end": 66.0, "text": "-But we ordered real pizza."}, {"start": 66.0, "end": 67.5375, "text": "-There's nothing more real than homemade."}, {"start": 67.5375, "end": 69.0, "text": "You didn't have some of the ingredients"}, {"start": 69.0, "end": 71.41379310344827, "text": "so I used ketchup and cream cheese."}, {"start": 71.41379310344827, "end": 73.0, "text": "-We ordered real pizza."}, {"start": 73.0, "end": 75.45, "text": "-Oh, I'll bet."}, {"start": 75.45, "end": 76.325, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 76.325, "end": 80.0, "text": "-Hey, I got you that."}, {"start": 80.0, "end": 83.75, "text": "Bienvenido de la Casa Cez Trobed."}, {"start": 83.75, "end": 85.0, "text": "-Very nice."}, {"start": 85.0, "end": 85.76923076923077, "text": "-Oh, look."}, {"start": 85.76923076923077, "end": 90.0, "text": "Indiana Jones and the apartment of perpetual virginity."}, {"start": 90.0, "end": 92.7, "text": "-Chop busted, fellow adult."}, {"start": 92.7, "end": 93.9, "text": "Chop busted."}, {"start": 93.9, "end": 95.0, "text": "-It's nice."}, {"start": 95.0, "end": 96.77777777777777, "text": "Not mansion nice, but it's nice."}, {"start": 96.77777777777777, "end": 99.0, "text": "Didn't you use living a mansion with me?"}, {"start": 99.0, "end": 101.72727272727273, "text": "-Yeah, but this is more my speed and sensory."}, {"start": 101.72727272727273, "end": 103.0, "text": "-It didn't bother me."}, {"start": 103.0, "end": 106.0, "text": "I've hardly missed you at all since I had you removed from my portraits."}, {"start": 106.0, "end": 107.9, "text": "Jeff, check it out."}, {"start": 107.9, "end": 109.10000000000001, "text": "Serbian rum."}, {"start": 109.10000000000001, "end": 112.0, "text": "So strong it is banned there."}, {"start": 112.0, "end": 114.39583333333333, "text": "Banned in Serbia, Jeff."}, {"start": 114.39583333333333, "end": 117.0, "text": "Let that concept sink in."}, {"start": 117.0, "end": 117.93877551020408, "text": "-Yeah, well, you enjoy."}, {"start": 117.93877551020408, "end": 118.83673469387755, "text": "I have to leave early."}, {"start": 118.83673469387755, "end": 119.0, "text": "-Oh?"}, {"start": 119.0, "end": 119.63934426229508, "text": "-Yeah, sorry."}, {"start": 119.63934426229508, "end": 122.0, "text": "I've got an invite to the opening of a new club."}, {"start": 122.0, "end": 123.0754716981132, "text": "Look at this place."}, {"start": 123.0754716981132, "end": 125.0, "text": "Looks like it was designed for me."}, {"start": 125.0, "end": 125.24615384615385, "text": "-It was."}, {"start": 125.24615384615385, "end": 127.0, "text": "I made that in Photoshop and mailed it to you a month ago"}, {"start": 127.0, "end": 129.0, "text": "so that you'd keep tonight open on your calendar."}, {"start": 129.0, "end": 132.0, "text": "-There's no such thing as single malt platinum boobs in Billiards Club?"}, {"start": 132.0, "end": 136.0, "text": "-I guess I never said it out loud."}, {"start": 136.0, "end": 138.0, "text": "-Tonight we offer something far more than boobs in Billiards."}, {"start": 138.0, "end": 138.6, "text": "-What?"}, {"start": 138.6, "end": 141.0, "text": "One word, two syllables."}, {"start": 141.0, "end": 143.22222222222223, "text": "-Don't say charades."}, {"start": 143.22222222222223, "end": 144.0, "text": "-Yatsy!"}, {"start": 144.0, "end": 147.0, "text": "-Is charades off the table?"}, {"start": 162.0, "end": 166.0, "text": "♪ I can't believe the size you stay ♪"}, {"start": 166.0, "end": 171.0, "text": "♪ Walk by one, they all just fade away ♪"}, {"start": 177.0, "end": 178.44827586206895, "text": "-Okay."}, {"start": 178.44827586206895, "end": 184.0, "text": "Now, how to play Yatsy?"}, {"start": 184.0, "end": 188.0, "text": "-Is there nothing from our youth that these companies won't repackage for a buck?"}, {"start": 188.0, "end": 189.57575757575756, "text": "Call a Yatsy all you want."}, {"start": 189.57575757575756, "end": 192.0, "text": "Everybody knows it's Puerto Rican chess."}, {"start": 194.0, "end": 195.68, "text": "-Annie, it's just the pizza."}, {"start": 195.68, "end": 197.0, "text": "-We can't buzz 'em up."}, {"start": 197.0, "end": 200.0, "text": "Someone has to go down."}, {"start": 200.0, "end": 200.7246376811594, "text": "-Ah, okay."}, {"start": 200.7246376811594, "end": 205.0, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 205.0, "end": 207.0, "text": "-Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 207.0, "end": 209.0, "text": "-Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 213.0, "end": 213.42105263157896, "text": "Two."}, {"start": 213.42105263157896, "end": 214.3684210526316, "text": "One, two."}, {"start": 214.3684210526316, "end": 215.0, "text": "Annie."}, {"start": 215.0, "end": 215.68571428571428, "text": "-Okay, fine."}, {"start": 215.68571428571428, "end": 217.0, "text": "I guess I'm going down."}, {"start": 217.0, "end": 219.0, "text": "-All this talk of going down."}, {"start": 219.0, "end": 222.0, "text": "-Did you guys know I had sex with Eartha Kitt in an airplane bathroom?"}, {"start": 222.0, "end": 224.0, "text": "-Oh, you're about to ease."}, {"start": 224.0, "end": 226.0, "text": "Name dropping comes up organically."}, {"start": 226.0, "end": 228.0, "text": "-I'm gonna check it on my pies."}, {"start": 228.0, "end": 228.85714285714286, "text": "-No."}, {"start": 228.85714285714286, "end": 231.0, "text": "-Bathroom?"}, {"start": 231.0, "end": 234.0, "text": "-Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 234.0, "end": 234.85106382978722, "text": "-Uh, guys?"}, {"start": 234.85106382978722, "end": 238.0, "text": "What does a pregnancy test look like?"}, {"start": 238.0, "end": 240.0, "text": "-It's like a thin piece of plastic with a thing on the end of it."}, {"start": 240.0, "end": 242.0, "text": "-Okay, so this is definitely a gun."}, {"start": 242.0, "end": 242.46153846153845, "text": "-Whoa!"}, {"start": 242.46153846153845, "end": 244.0, "text": "Yeah, put that away."}, {"start": 244.0, "end": 246.0, "text": "-Why does Annie have a gun?"}, {"start": 246.0, "end": 246.7826086956522, "text": "-That's not a gun."}, {"start": 246.7826086956522, "end": 248.0, "text": "That's a girl's pea shooter."}, {"start": 248.0, "end": 249.1, "text": "Here, Troy."}, {"start": 249.1, "end": 251.0, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 251.0, "end": 253.0, "text": "-Jeff, what are we gonna do about this?"}, {"start": 253.0, "end": 255.0, "text": "-I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 255.0, "end": 255.57142857142858, "text": "-Ow!"}, {"start": 255.57142857142858, "end": 258.0, "text": "-That's so funny."}, {"start": 258.0, "end": 258.5833333333333, "text": "-I don't know."}, {"start": 258.5833333333333, "end": 260.0, "text": "People are getting their heads up."}, {"start": 260.0, "end": 263.0, "text": "-Don't fight over them."}, {"start": 263.0, "end": 266.0, "text": "-Wait, you can fight a little."}, {"start": 266.0, "end": 268.0, "text": "-Smells weird."}, {"start": 268.0, "end": 269.0, "text": "-I beg your pardon?"}, {"start": 269.0, "end": 269.93333333333334, "text": "-Smells weird."}, {"start": 269.93333333333334, "end": 271.0, "text": "What did you do?"}, {"start": 271.0, "end": 273.0, "text": "-Abed, you don't ask someone a question like that."}, {"start": 273.0, "end": 275.0, "text": "It's not dignified."}, {"start": 275.0, "end": 277.0, "text": "-Pizza!"}, {"start": 277.0, "end": 281.0, "text": "-Pizza, pizza, go and tummy me so hungy me so hungy."}, {"start": 281.0, "end": 283.0, "text": "-Pizza guy was super creepy."}, {"start": 283.0, "end": 287.0, "text": "-So you're saying he was a pizza guy?"}, {"start": 287.0, "end": 289.0, "text": "-I wonder what happened in those other timelines."}, {"start": 289.0, "end": 292.0, "text": "-Abed, there are no other timelines."}, {"start": 292.0, "end": 294.0, "text": "[buzzer sounds]"}, {"start": 294.0, "end": 294.72463768115944, "text": "-Ah, okay."}, {"start": 294.72463768115944, "end": 299.0, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 299.0, "end": 301.0, "text": "-Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 301.0, "end": 303.0, "text": "-Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 303.0, "end": 307.0, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 307.0, "end": 307.34285714285716, "text": "-Four."}, {"start": 307.34285714285716, "end": 308.6, "text": "One, two, three, four."}, {"start": 308.6, "end": 309.0, "text": "Surely."}, {"start": 309.0, "end": 309.52941176470586, "text": "-Okay."}, {"start": 309.52941176470586, "end": 312.0, "text": "Just don't let my pies burn."}, {"start": 312.0, "end": 314.0, "text": "[upbeat music]"}, {"start": 314.0, "end": 316.0, "text": "-Remember, no one eats those pies."}, {"start": 316.0, "end": 318.0, "text": "-Come on, let's just talk to her."}, {"start": 318.0, "end": 320.0, "text": "-We tried that, Annie, but she ignored us."}, {"start": 320.0, "end": 322.0, "text": "The woman has a baking problem."}, {"start": 322.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "Now, I don't like being the bad guy any more than anybody else."}, {"start": 324.0, "end": 325.0, "text": "-Right!"}, {"start": 325.0, "end": 327.0, "text": "-No!"}, {"start": 327.0, "end": 328.0, "text": "-Bathroom?"}, {"start": 328.0, "end": 330.0, "text": "-Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 330.0, "end": 331.3953488372093, "text": "-We have a pat."}, {"start": 331.3953488372093, "end": 334.0, "text": "We do not enable her baking."}, {"start": 334.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "It's going to be better for her in the long run."}, {"start": 336.0, "end": 338.0, "text": "-You know who got it in the long run."}, {"start": 338.0, "end": 341.0, "text": "There's a kid when I nailed her in the airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 341.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "-Oh, seriously?"}, {"start": 342.0, "end": 343.0, "text": "-What?"}, {"start": 343.0, "end": 344.37142857142857, "text": "-It came up organically."}, {"start": 344.37142857142857, "end": 345.0, "text": "Here, Troy."}, {"start": 345.0, "end": 347.0, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 347.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "-Oh, cool."}, {"start": 349.0, "end": 351.0, "text": "-Thanks, please."}, {"start": 351.0, "end": 353.0, "text": "-Whoa!"}, {"start": 353.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "-What is it?"}, {"start": 354.0, "end": 357.0, "text": "-It's a traditional Norwegian troll."}, {"start": 357.0, "end": 359.0, "text": "When Troy and I were living together, I had it on display in the hall."}, {"start": 359.0, "end": 361.0, "text": "You know, outside his bedroom."}, {"start": 361.0, "end": 364.0, "text": "BC would very take it with it."}, {"start": 364.0, "end": 366.0, "text": "It used to watch me sleep."}, {"start": 366.0, "end": 368.0, "text": "-Pierce, shame on you."}, {"start": 368.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "Jeff, what are you going to do about this?"}, {"start": 369.0, "end": 371.0, "text": "-I'm going to get a drink."}, {"start": 371.0, "end": 372.0, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 372.0, "end": 372.48, "text": "-Oh, my God."}, {"start": 372.48, "end": 373.0, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 373.0, "end": 374.0, "text": "-I barely felt it."}, {"start": 374.0, "end": 376.0, "text": "-Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 376.0, "end": 378.0, "text": "It's not dignified."}, {"start": 378.0, "end": 379.0, "text": "-Pizza!"}, {"start": 379.0, "end": 380.0, "text": "Pizza, pizza."}, {"start": 380.0, "end": 381.0, "text": "In my tummy."}, {"start": 381.0, "end": 383.0, "text": "Me so hungry."}, {"start": 383.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "Me so hungry."}, {"start": 384.0, "end": 388.0, "text": "-Did someone remember to take out my pie?"}, {"start": 388.0, "end": 389.0, "text": "Seriously?"}, {"start": 389.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 391.0, "end": 393.0, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 393.0, "end": 396.0, "text": "Oh, no."}, {"start": 396.0, "end": 397.0, "text": "Seriously?"}, {"start": 397.0, "end": 399.0, "text": "-Surely, it doesn't matter."}, {"start": 399.0, "end": 400.0, "text": "We weren't going to eat them."}, {"start": 400.0, "end": 403.0, "text": "You're not allowed to have baking things as an identity."}, {"start": 403.0, "end": 404.0, "text": "-Excuse me."}, {"start": 404.0, "end": 407.0, "text": "For being the only married woman in a group full of horny toads"}, {"start": 407.0, "end": 410.0, "text": "who sit around all night just making googly eyes at each other."}, {"start": 410.0, "end": 411.0, "text": "-Googly eyes?"}, {"start": 411.0, "end": 413.0, "text": "-Go!"}, {"start": 417.1, "end": 418.1, "text": "-Surely, it's okay."}, {"start": 418.1, "end": 420.1, "text": "Nobody makes googly eyes at me either."}, {"start": 420.1, "end": 422.1, "text": "I'm just saying."}, {"start": 424.1, "end": 425.1, "text": "-Surely."}, {"start": 425.1, "end": 426.1, "text": "-Surely."}, {"start": 428.1, "end": 429.1, "text": "Adios, Sabito."}, {"start": 431.1, "end": 432.1, "text": "-I don't know why she's so upset."}, {"start": 432.1, "end": 434.1, "text": "Her pies probably didn't burn in the other timelines."}, {"start": 434.1, "end": 436.1, "text": "-Abed, Shirley just had a nervous breakdown."}, {"start": 436.1, "end": 438.1, "text": "-More like a nervous breakdown."}, {"start": 438.1, "end": 438.3058823529412, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 438.3058823529412, "end": 439.1, "text": "I didn't say it on purpose."}, {"start": 439.1, "end": 442.1, "text": "And, Abed, there are no other timelines."}, {"start": 444.1, "end": 445.1, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 445.1, "end": 447.1, "text": "Starting on my left with one."}, {"start": 447.1, "end": 447.85, "text": "Your number comes up."}, {"start": 447.85, "end": 448.1, "text": "You go."}, {"start": 448.1, "end": 450.1, "text": "-Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 450.1, "end": 452.1, "text": "-Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 459.1, "end": 460.1, "text": "-Three."}, {"start": 460.1, "end": 461.1, "text": "One, two, three."}, {"start": 461.1, "end": 462.1, "text": "Pierce."}, {"start": 462.1, "end": 464.1, "text": "-Crap."}, {"start": 464.1, "end": 466.1, "text": "Speaking of crap, I was taking one in an airplane bathroom"}, {"start": 466.1, "end": 468.1, "text": "when Eartha Kitt decided to bang me."}, {"start": 468.1, "end": 469.1, "text": "-Oh!"}, {"start": 469.1, "end": 470.1, "text": "-What?"}, {"start": 470.1, "end": 471.1, "text": "That's where my mind went."}, {"start": 471.1, "end": 473.1, "text": "-Your mind went years ago."}, {"start": 476.1, "end": 477.1, "text": "-I'm going to check on my pies."}, {"start": 477.1, "end": 478.1, "text": "Ah!"}, {"start": 478.1, "end": 479.1, "text": "-No!"}, {"start": 481.1, "end": 482.1, "text": "-Bathroom?"}, {"start": 482.1, "end": 483.1, "text": "-Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 483.1, "end": 485.1, "text": "-I love your place, Troy."}, {"start": 485.1, "end": 487.1, "text": "You're all grown up now."}, {"start": 487.1, "end": 491.1, "text": "-I can't believe there's a real mahogany bunk bed in there."}, {"start": 491.1, "end": 493.1, "text": "I bet that cost you a few allowances."}, {"start": 495.1, "end": 496.1, "text": "-Oh, Troy!"}, {"start": 496.1, "end": 497.1, "text": "-Now we've done it."}, {"start": 498.1, "end": 499.1, "text": "-Britties in the bath--"}, {"start": 499.1, "end": 501.1, "text": "Adios, Sabito."}, {"start": 505.1, "end": 507.1, "text": "-Who is it?"}, {"start": 507.1, "end": 508.1, "text": "-Troy."}, {"start": 508.1, "end": 509.1, "text": "-Washing my hands."}, {"start": 509.1, "end": 510.1, "text": "-Good."}, {"start": 510.1, "end": 511.1, "text": "Then I can come in."}, {"start": 512.1, "end": 513.1, "text": "-Oh, hi."}, {"start": 514.1, "end": 517.1, "text": "Um, I was smoking a cigarette."}, {"start": 517.1, "end": 518.1, "text": "-I know what you were doing."}, {"start": 518.1, "end": 520.1, "text": "I'm 21 years old."}, {"start": 520.1, "end": 521.1, "text": "I'm a man."}, {"start": 528.1, "end": 529.1, "text": "-I know that."}, {"start": 530.1, "end": 531.1, "text": "We all know that."}, {"start": 531.1, "end": 533.1, "text": "-Then why is Jeff always picking on me?"}, {"start": 534.1, "end": 536.1, "text": "-You seem to be a little hard on Troy lately."}, {"start": 536.1, "end": 537.1, "text": "-I'm going to get a drink."}, {"start": 538.1, "end": 539.1, "text": "-Ow!"}, {"start": 539.1, "end": 539.58, "text": "-Oh, my God."}, {"start": 539.58, "end": 540.1, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 540.1, "end": 541.1, "text": "-I barely felt it."}, {"start": 541.1, "end": 542.1, "text": "-Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 542.1, "end": 543.1, "text": "-Britties in the bathroom."}, {"start": 543.1, "end": 544.1, "text": "-Oh, um--"}, {"start": 544.1, "end": 544.8272727272728, "text": "-Oh, no."}, {"start": 544.8272727272728, "end": 546.1, "text": "What happened?"}, {"start": 549.044, "end": 550.044, "text": "-A minor head wound."}, {"start": 550.044, "end": 552.044, "text": "If there's an abrasion, we'll clean it with iodine and apply ice."}, {"start": 552.044, "end": 554.044, "text": "-You make a good nurse."}, {"start": 554.044, "end": 555.044, "text": "-Thanks."}, {"start": 555.044, "end": 555.204, "text": "-Dr."}, {"start": 555.204, "end": 557.044, "text": "Shirley says mini pies are the best medicine--"}, {"start": 557.044, "end": 558.044, "text": "-Then I'd like to see her degree."}, {"start": 559.044, "end": 562.044, "text": "-He's butting antlers with you because you're a threat now."}, {"start": 562.044, "end": 563.044, "text": "You've got your own place."}, {"start": 563.044, "end": 565.044, "text": "You've got a future."}, {"start": 565.044, "end": 568.044, "text": "You've got a bowl full of olives next to the toilet."}, {"start": 568.044, "end": 570.044, "text": "-It's a fancy party, Britta."}, {"start": 570.044, "end": 572.044, "text": "-You know what Jeff has in his bathroom?"}, {"start": 573.044, "end": 574.044, "text": "Neither do I."}, {"start": 574.044, "end": 577.044, "text": "He keeps his toiletries in a safe under the sink."}, {"start": 578.044, "end": 581.044, "text": "His whole personality is based around guarding himself."}, {"start": 581.044, "end": 583.044, "text": "You don't have to be like that to be a man."}, {"start": 583.044, "end": 585.044, "text": "-You're really cool, Britta."}, {"start": 588.749, "end": 589.749, "text": "-Man!"}, {"start": 589.749, "end": 591.749, "text": "Pizza guys are getting worse and worse looking."}, {"start": 591.749, "end": 593.749, "text": "-I guess all the good ones went into porn."}, {"start": 593.749, "end": 594.749, "text": "-Sealing fan."}, {"start": 594.749, "end": 595.749, "text": "-I miss all the fun."}, {"start": 595.749, "end": 597.749, "text": "-I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 597.749, "end": 598.749, "text": "-Who cares?"}, {"start": 598.749, "end": 599.749, "text": "-Who cares?"}, {"start": 606.749, "end": 607.749, "text": "-Okay."}, {"start": 607.749, "end": 610.749, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 610.749, "end": 612.749, "text": "-Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 612.749, "end": 614.749, "text": "-Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 618.749, "end": 619.749, "text": "Six."}, {"start": 619.749, "end": 621.749, "text": "One, two, three, four, five, six, Britta."}, {"start": 621.749, "end": 622.749, "text": "-Great."}, {"start": 622.749, "end": 623.749, "text": "-Great."}, {"start": 623.749, "end": 624.749, "text": "You know what's great?"}, {"start": 624.749, "end": 625.749, "text": "Air travel."}, {"start": 625.749, "end": 628.749, "text": "I've flown a lot, a lot of airplane stores."}, {"start": 628.749, "end": 629.749, "text": "I once had sex with Earth a kid."}, {"start": 629.749, "end": 630.749, "text": "-Okay."}, {"start": 630.749, "end": 631.749, "text": "I'm going to check on my price."}, {"start": 638.749, "end": 639.749, "text": "-You guys are my best--"}, {"start": 639.749, "end": 640.749, "text": "-I'm not going to drink."}, {"start": 640.818, "end": 642.122347826087, "text": "Oh my god!"}, {"start": 642.122347826087, "end": 643.818, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 643.818, "end": 644.818, "text": "Barely felt it."}, {"start": 644.818, "end": 647.818, "text": "Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 648.818, "end": 650.818, "text": "Did that mean to refill the toilet dollars?"}, {"start": 650.818, "end": 651.3418095238095, "text": "We're good."}, {"start": 651.3418095238095, "end": 651.818, "text": "I checked."}, {"start": 651.818, "end": 652.818, "text": "You're the best."}, {"start": 652.818, "end": 653.818, "text": "Want to stay up all night talking to our bunk beds?"}, {"start": 653.818, "end": 654.818, "text": "Do do!"}, {"start": 654.818, "end": 655.918, "text": "Here, Troy."}, {"start": 655.918, "end": 657.818, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 657.818, "end": 658.943, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 658.943, "end": 660.818, "text": "Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 660.818, "end": 662.818, "text": "You make a good nurse, Annie."}, {"start": 662.818, "end": 663.473737704918, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 663.473737704918, "end": 666.818, "text": "I actually had to apply a tourniquet the other day."}, {"start": 666.818, "end": 668.818, "text": "Like I got stabbed outside my building."}, {"start": 668.818, "end": 669.0811578947369, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 669.0811578947369, "end": 671.818, "text": "Annie, you gotta get the hell out of that apartment."}, {"start": 671.818, "end": 674.818, "text": "You don't have to treat me like a kidney more, remember?"}, {"start": 674.818, "end": 677.818, "text": "Yeah, but adults still need to be protected."}, {"start": 677.818, "end": 680.818, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 680.818, "end": 682.818, "text": "You're important to me."}, {"start": 682.818, "end": 683.818, "text": "[Screaming]"}, {"start": 687.419, "end": 688.419, "text": "[Screaming]"}, {"start": 688.419, "end": 689.419, "text": "[Screaming]"}, {"start": 689.419, "end": 690.419, "text": "[Screaming]"}, {"start": 690.419, "end": 691.419, "text": "[Screaming]"}, {"start": 691.419, "end": 692.419, "text": "Norwegian Troy!"}, {"start": 692.419, "end": 694.419, "text": "What's going on in here?"}, {"start": 694.419, "end": 696.419, "text": "Here's to terrorizing Troy because he's jealous we moved in together."}, {"start": 696.419, "end": 697.419, "text": "You're the one who's jealous."}, {"start": 697.419, "end": 698.419, "text": "Why would I be jealous?"}, {"start": 698.419, "end": 701.419, "text": "Because you're lonely and crazy."}, {"start": 701.419, "end": 702.0572978723404, "text": "Hey, guys."}, {"start": 702.0572978723404, "end": 704.419, "text": "This is Toby, our pizza delivery guy,"}, {"start": 709.757, "end": 711.757, "text": "and I know this is gonna sound nuts,"}, {"start": 711.757, "end": 714.757, "text": "but we're in love and we're getting married."}, {"start": 721.757, "end": 723.757, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 723.757, "end": 724.2408709677419, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 724.2408709677419, "end": 726.757, "text": "There are other timelines?"}, {"start": 728.757, "end": 729.4187647058823, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 729.4187647058823, "end": 733.757, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 733.757, "end": 735.757, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 735.757, "end": 737.757, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 741.757, "end": 742.2014444444444, "text": "One."}, {"start": 742.2014444444444, "end": 742.757, "text": "Troy."}, {"start": 742.757, "end": 743.757, "text": "Damn it."}, {"start": 743.757, "end": 746.757, "text": "I'm gonna go as fast as I can so I don't miss anything."}, {"start": 749.757, "end": 751.757, "text": "You know who I used to call miss anything?"}, {"start": 751.757, "end": 753.757, "text": "You're the kid."}, {"start": 753.757, "end": 755.757, "text": "Totally set it up."}, {"start": 755.757, "end": 758.757, "text": "I'm checking on my pies."}, {"start": 758.757, "end": 760.757, "text": "No."}, {"start": 760.757, "end": 761.757, "text": "Bathroom?"}, {"start": 761.757, "end": 763.757, "text": "Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 763.757, "end": 765.757, "text": "Jeff, tell us about your father."}, {"start": 765.757, "end": 767.757, "text": "I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 767.757, "end": 768.6736666666666, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 768.6736666666666, "end": 769.757, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 769.757, "end": 770.757, "text": "I barely felt it."}, {"start": 770.757, "end": 772.757, "text": "Let me look it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 779.757, "end": 781.757, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 785.757, "end": 787.757, "text": "Call number one!"}, {"start": 787.757, "end": 793.757, "text": "Help me stop the bleeding!"}, {"start": 793.757, "end": 794.7093809523809, "text": "I'm dying!"}, {"start": 794.7093809523809, "end": 795.757, "text": "I am dying!"}, {"start": 800.757, "end": 801.757, "text": "Water!"}, {"start": 801.757, "end": 802.757, "text": "Water!"}, {"start": 817.757, "end": 818.8158235294117, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 818.8158235294117, "end": 825.757, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 825.757, "end": 827.757, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 827.757, "end": 829.757, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 836.757, "end": 837.0201578947368, "text": "Five."}, {"start": 837.0201578947368, "end": 838.4938421052632, "text": "One, two, three, four, five."}, {"start": 838.4938421052632, "end": 838.757, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 838.757, "end": 839.757, "text": "I'm on it."}, {"start": 839.757, "end": 841.3723846153846, "text": "You know who else was on it?"}, {"start": 841.3723846153846, "end": 842.757, "text": "And you know what it is."}, {"start": 842.757, "end": 844.757, "text": "Everybody give me money."}, {"start": 844.757, "end": 848.757, "text": "Well, that mascot really softens your personality."}, {"start": 848.757, "end": 850.757, "text": "I banged her with the kid."}, {"start": 851.757, "end": 853.757, "text": "Faster!"}, {"start": 854.757, "end": 855.757, "text": "Bathroom?"}, {"start": 855.757, "end": 857.757, "text": "Down the hall."}, {"start": 859.757, "end": 861.757, "text": "Here's a little drink."}, {"start": 861.757, "end": 862.757, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 862.757, "end": 863.6736666666666, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 863.6736666666666, "end": 864.757, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 864.757, "end": 865.757, "text": "Barely felt it."}, {"start": 865.757, "end": 866.757, "text": "Well, let me look it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 866.757, "end": 867.757, "text": "Where is it in the bathroom?"}, {"start": 867.757, "end": 869.757, "text": "Oh, um..."}, {"start": 871.757, "end": 872.4236666666666, "text": "Oh, no."}, {"start": 872.4236666666666, "end": 873.757, "text": "What happened?"}, {"start": 873.757, "end": 874.757, "text": "Our head wounds."}, {"start": 876.757, "end": 877.4666774193548, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 877.4666774193548, "end": 878.757, "text": "What smells amazing?"}, {"start": 878.757, "end": 880.757, "text": "Oh, someone wants pie!"}, {"start": 881.757, "end": 883.757, "text": "You look a good nurse."}, {"start": 886.757, "end": 887.6197450980392, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 887.6197450980392, "end": 890.757, "text": "They taste just like regular sized pies."}, {"start": 890.757, "end": 891.757, "text": "Oh, yay!"}, {"start": 891.757, "end": 893.7927142857143, "text": "Happy house for me."}, {"start": 893.7927142857143, "end": 894.757, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 894.757, "end": 896.757, "text": "Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 896.757, "end": 900.757, "text": "Hey, while we're alone, I just want to say thanks for letting me live with you."}, {"start": 900.757, "end": 904.757, "text": "Sometimes I feel like making desserts is the only thing I'm good for in the group."}, {"start": 904.757, "end": 908.757, "text": "But now it's time for me to try making it on my own, just like you did."}, {"start": 909.757, "end": 910.757, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 910.757, "end": 912.757, "text": "Yeah, I don't think you should open it."}, {"start": 912.757, "end": 913.007, "text": "No, what?"}, {"start": 913.007, "end": 913.757, "text": "What are you talking about?"}, {"start": 913.757, "end": 915.757, "text": "You're very important to me."}, {"start": 916.757, "end": 916.9808805970149, "text": "Crap."}, {"start": 916.9808805970149, "end": 918.6375970149254, "text": "I was not supposed to eat your stuff."}, {"start": 918.6375970149254, "end": 919.757, "text": "We all made an agreement."}, {"start": 919.757, "end": 919.9792222222221, "text": "Crap."}, {"start": 919.9792222222221, "end": 921.757, "text": "I was not supposed to say that out loud."}, {"start": 921.757, "end": 922.0248571428571, "text": "Crap!"}, {"start": 922.0248571428571, "end": 923.3641428571427, "text": "Okay, cards on the table."}, {"start": 923.3641428571427, "end": 924.757, "text": "I'm really high right now."}, {"start": 924.757, "end": 925.757, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 926.757, "end": 929.0236666666666, "text": "I want to give you something else."}, {"start": 929.0236666666666, "end": 929.8903333333333, "text": "A water pick."}, {"start": 929.8903333333333, "end": 930.6903333333332, "text": "A speedboat."}, {"start": 930.6903333333332, "end": 931.757, "text": "Two water picks."}, {"start": 931.757, "end": 934.757, "text": "I can't believe I'm feeding my pies to a drug addict."}, {"start": 934.757, "end": 935.9236666666666, "text": "A drug addict?"}, {"start": 935.9236666666666, "end": 937.5903333333332, "text": "You're a pie pusher."}, {"start": 937.5903333333332, "end": 939.757, "text": "You push pies to get love."}, {"start": 939.757, "end": 941.4121724137931, "text": "Give it, Pierce."}, {"start": 941.4121724137931, "end": 942.757, "text": "It feels fun."}, {"start": 943.757, "end": 944.838081081081, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 944.838081081081, "end": 947.757, "text": "I just had a weird deja vu."}, {"start": 947.757, "end": 948.757, "text": "You're bad at gift giving."}, {"start": 948.757, "end": 951.5775128205128, "text": "That thing you said about worrying about me?"}, {"start": 951.5775128205128, "end": 953.757, "text": "It's something my dad always said."}, {"start": 953.757, "end": 954.757, "text": "I demand to be house warned."}, {"start": 954.757, "end": 956.757, "text": "I shouldn't have brought it up."}, {"start": 956.757, "end": 959.1894324324323, "text": "It just reminded me of my dad."}, {"start": 959.1894324324323, "end": 959.757, "text": "Anyway."}, {"start": 959.757, "end": 961.6517368421053, "text": "Uh, little make-out 101."}, {"start": 961.6517368421053, "end": 962.757, "text": "Less dad talk."}, {"start": 962.757, "end": 965.757, "text": "And, uh, you could ease up on the bubblegum lip gloss."}, {"start": 965.757, "end": 966.5805294117647, "text": "Oh, no."}, {"start": 966.5805294117647, "end": 967.757, "text": "I really--"}, {"start": 967.757, "end": 969.757, "text": "No, you!"}, {"start": 972.757, "end": 973.4169999999999, "text": "Pizza time!"}, {"start": 973.4169999999999, "end": 975.757, "text": "Give me this, you godless hippies cake!"}, {"start": 975.757, "end": 979.757, "text": "You're a sick, sad, twisted old man, and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 979.757, "end": 981.757, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 984.757, "end": 986.757, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 992.094, "end": 993.5242325581396, "text": "I gotta say, I hope this is the real one,"}, {"start": 993.5242325581396, "end": 995.094, "text": "because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 1000.094, "end": 1000.6234117647059, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 1000.6234117647059, "end": 1004.094, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1004.094, "end": 1006.094, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.094, "end": 1008.094, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 1013.094, "end": 1015.094, "text": "I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1016.094, "end": 1017.9084329896908, "text": "Chaos already dominates enough of our lives."}, {"start": 1017.9084329896908, "end": 1020.094, "text": "The universe is an endless, raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1020.094, "end": 1023.094, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it, but to weather it together."}, {"start": 1023.094, "end": 1024.019925925926, "text": "On the raft of life."}, {"start": 1024.019925925926, "end": 1025.8717777777779, "text": "A raft held together by those few, rare,"}, {"start": 1025.8717777777779, "end": 1028.094, "text": "beautiful things that we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.094, "end": 1028.8212727272728, "text": "Ropes?"}, {"start": 1028.8212727272728, "end": 1029.5485454545455, "text": "Vines?"}, {"start": 1029.5485454545455, "end": 1030.2758181818183, "text": "Vines?"}, {"start": 1030.2758181818183, "end": 1032.094, "text": "Let him finish!"}, {"start": 1032.094, "end": 1034.094, "text": "Us."}, {"start": 1034.094, "end": 1035.8717777777779, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us as long as we"}, {"start": 1035.8717777777779, "end": 1038.094, "text": "stay honest and accepting of each other's flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.094, "end": 1039.5422758620691, "text": "Annie will always be driven."}, {"start": 1039.5422758620691, "end": 1041.094, "text": "Shirley will always be giving."}, {"start": 1041.094, "end": 1044.586537313433, "text": "Pierce will never apologize, Britt is sort of a wild card from my perspective."}, {"start": 1044.586537313433, "end": 1047.094, "text": "And Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1047.094, "end": 1050.094, "text": "There are six sides to this die and seven of us."}, {"start": 1050.094, "end": 1052.094, "text": "He divides the system by which he never has to get the pizza."}, {"start": 1052.094, "end": 1054.094, "text": "Jack, Willie!"}, {"start": 1054.094, "end": 1055.094, "text": "Crafty Jackrabbit!"}, {"start": 1055.094, "end": 1056.094, "text": "Dag, man."}, {"start": 1056.094, "end": 1057.1089253731343, "text": "Pretty low, dude."}, {"start": 1057.1089253731343, "end": 1060.094, "text": "It's called friendship, look it up, and car to it."}, {"start": 1061.094, "end": 1063.094, "text": "I think we just found our pizza-getter."}, {"start": 1063.094, "end": 1065.094, "text": "Yes, Jeff!"}, {"start": 1065.094, "end": 1068.094, "text": "Oh, like it matters who goes."}, {"start": 1070.094, "end": 1071.094, "text": "This is so funny."}, {"start": 1071.094, "end": 1073.094, "text": "Good karma."}, {"start": 1073.094, "end": 1076.094, "text": "That guy sucks harder than the toilet in an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1076.094, "end": 1078.094, "text": "Airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1078.094, "end": 1079.094, "text": "Oh, my pies."}, {"start": 1079.094, "end": 1081.094, "text": "Rocks!"}, {"start": 1081.094, "end": 1083.094, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1083.094, "end": 1086.094, "text": "You don't have to put on the red lights."}, {"start": 1087.094, "end": 1089.094, "text": "Don't sing the whole thing."}, {"start": 1089.094, "end": 1090.094, "text": "Hold on."}, {"start": 1090.094, "end": 1093.094, "text": "You don't have to send your mother to the night."}, {"start": 1093.094, "end": 1095.094, "text": "Sing, girl."}, {"start": 1095.094, "end": 1096.094, "text": "Rocks!"}, {"start": 1096.094, "end": 1097.094, "text": "I really love your plays."}, {"start": 1097.094, "end": 1098.094, "text": "You should move here."}, {"start": 1098.094, "end": 1101.094, "text": "You don't have to wear that dress tonight."}, {"start": 1103.094, "end": 1105.094, "text": "Walk the streets for money."}, {"start": 1105.094, "end": 1109.094, "text": "You don't care if it's wrong or if it's right."}, {"start": 1109.094, "end": 1111.094, "text": "Rocks!"}, {"start": 1112.094, "end": 1115.094, "text": "You don't have to put on the red lights."}, {"start": 1116.094, "end": 1118.094, "text": "You guys see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.094, "end": 1122.094, "text": "You don't have to put on the red lights."}, {"start": 1123.094, "end": 1124.094, "text": "Rocks!"}, {"start": 1124.094, "end": 1126.094, "text": "Put on the red lights!"}, {"start": 1127.094, "end": 1129.094, "text": "Put on the red lights!"}, {"start": 1129.094, "end": 1130.094, "text": "Don't try!"}, {"start": 1130.094, "end": 1131.094, "text": "Rocks!"}, {"start": 1131.094, "end": 1133.094, "text": "Put on the red lights!"}, {"start": 1134.094, "end": 1136.094, "text": "Put on the red lights!"}, {"start": 1139.094, "end": 1140.094, "text": "To Pierce."}, {"start": 1140.094, "end": 1142.094, "text": "May he rest in Pierce."}, {"start": 1144.094, "end": 1146.094, "text": "Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.094, "end": 1147.094, "text": "Of you."}, {"start": 1148.094, "end": 1150.094, "text": "Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.094, "end": 1151.094, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.094, "end": 1153.094, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.094, "end": 1156.094, "text": "Enough with the timeline crap, Abed."}, {"start": 1156.094, "end": 1159.094, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1159.094, "end": 1161.3614418604652, "text": "Shirley's a drunk, and he's locked in a"}, {"start": 1161.3614418604652, "end": 1164.094, "text": "mental ward because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1164.094, "end": 1166.094, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.094, "end": 1169.6279805825243, "text": "Troy lost his larynx because for some dumb reason he"}, {"start": 1169.6279805825243, "end": 1173.094, "text": "tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1173.094, "end": 1176.094, "text": "Clearly you don't want to say anything about the baby troll."}, {"start": 1176.094, "end": 1179.094, "text": "Life has gone to hell, Abed!"}, {"start": 1179.094, "end": 1180.094, "text": "This is real!"}, {"start": 1180.094, "end": 1181.094, "text": "Look at us!"}, {"start": 1181.094, "end": 1182.094, "text": "Look at me!"}, {"start": 1182.094, "end": 1187.094, "text": "You put one washed-away blue streak in your hair, and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1187.094, "end": 1188.094, "text": "Exactly!"}, {"start": 1188.094, "end": 1189.094, "text": "Life got dark!"}, {"start": 1189.094, "end": 1190.094, "text": "And all because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.094, "end": 1192.094, "text": "Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.094, "end": 1193.094, "text": "It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.094, "end": 1194.6434505494506, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my"}, {"start": 1194.6434505494506, "end": 1196.094, "text": "head, and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.094, "end": 1199.094, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.094, "end": 1201.094, "text": "I failed to do that, and we all suffered for it."}, {"start": 1201.094, "end": 1203.094, "text": "But I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1205.094, "end": 1206.094, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 1206.094, "end": 1207.8259587628866, "text": "Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest, which"}, {"start": 1207.8259587628866, "end": 1209.094, "text": "is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.094, "end": 1210.6781584158416, "text": "I made us all black goatees out of felt."}, {"start": 1210.6781584158416, "end": 1213.094, "text": "I suggest you put them on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1215.094, "end": 1217.094, "text": "From now on, I'm evil Abed."}, {"start": 1217.094, "end": 1220.094, "text": "We are the evil study group, and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.094, "end": 1221.6637674418605, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline, the one"}, {"start": 1221.6637674418605, "end": 1223.094, "text": "that I stopped you from rolling that die."}, {"start": 1223.094, "end": 1227.094, "text": "Then we destroy the good versions of ourselves and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.094, "end": 1229.094, "text": "Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1229.094, "end": 1232.094, "text": "As evil Jeff, am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.094, "end": 1233.094, "text": "Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.094, "end": 1234.094, "text": "I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.094, "end": 1236.094, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.094, "end": 1240.094, "text": "I lost my damn arm, and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1240.094, "end": 1241.094, "text": "Go tease."}, {"start": 1253.162, "end": 1255.162, "text": "Evil Troy and Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1262.162, "end": 1264.162, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1265.162, "end": 1266.162, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1266.162, "end": 1268.162, "text": "We got out just in space."}, {"start": 1268.162, "end": 1271.162, "text": "Well, I certainly was right into that one, didn't I?"}, {"start": 1271.162, "end": 1272.162, "text": "I guess not, then."}]}